{"lyrics":"[00:03.28](We The Best Music)\n[00:05.72]They ain't believe in us\n[00:07.96]Juice WRLD did\n[00:09.72]DJ Khaled (Khaled, Khaled)\n[00:11.84]DJ Khaled with them straps, I got another one (uh-huh)\n[00:14.96]DJ Khaled, a hunnid racks, I made another one (uh-huh)\n[00:18.20]DJ Khaled with the tats, I got another one (uh-huh)\n[00:21.40]DJ Khaled, we the best, b-, I'm number one, uh-huh (let's go, let's go, let's go, let's go, let's go)\n[00:25.54]I'm rookie of the year, ain't no runnin' u-u-up (on God)\n[00:27.96]We ain't runnin' away from sh- we the ones runnin' u-u-up (that's on God)\n[00:31.16]No Limit gang, the only gang, ain't no other one (that's on God)\n[00:32.86]I'm gon' bang what I bang, ain't no changin' up (on God)\n[00:37.70]Ain't no changin' up (on God, on God)\n[00:40.22]I'ma do my thing (I'ma do my)\n[00:41.54]Married to this cash (married to this)\n[00:42.88]I'ma buy it a ring (let's go, let's go)\n[00:44.86]My dreads, they hang (let's go, let's go)\n[00:46.48]Like Shabba Ranks (Shabba Ranks)\n[00:48.22]My gun Chief Keef (yeah)\n[00:49.56]The b- go bang-bang (b-b-b-bow)\n[00:51.42]I rap, I sing (uh)\n[00:52.48]With the clan like it's Wu-Tang (uh)\n[00:54.08]But, I hate n- like Klu Klux (uh)\n[00:55.78]Run up on me, I don't give two f- (at all)\n[00:57.32]Chopper leave, n- so f- up (what else?)\n[00:58.50]Sewed up (what else?), sewed up (what else?)\n[01:00.76]Toe up from the floor up (uh-huh)\n[01:02.18]Sip lean 'til I throw up (uh-huh)\n[01:03.66]After I throw up, I'm gon' pour up (yeah)\n[01:05.40]I need another one (uh)\n[01:06.70]Heat up on my hip, I up like the sunrise, I got another sun (let's go, let's go)\n[01:09.94]Ran out of ammo, switched to my other holster, another gun (grah)\n[01:14.12]Damn, I'm like, \"He got another one?\" (he does, yeah)\n[01:16.72]DJ Khaled with them straps, I got another one (uh-huh)\n[01:20.14]DJ Khaled, a hunnid racks, I made another one (uh-huh)\n[01:23.06]DJ Khaled with the tats, I got another one (uh-huh)\n[01:26.28]DJ Khaled, we the best, b-, I'm number one, uh-huh (let's go, let's go, let's go, let's go, let's go)\n[01:29.60]I'm rookie of the year, ain't no runnin' u-u-up (on God)\n[01:32.82]We ain't runnin' away from sh- we the ones runnin' u-u-up (that's on God)\n[01:36.00]No Limit gang, the only gang, ain't no other one (that's on God)\n[01:37.76]I'm gon' bang what I bang, ain't no changin' up (on God)\n[01:42.56]Ain't no changin' up (on God, on God)\n[01:44.58]My gun, a horny one (it is), that b- a thot alright (she will)\n[01:47.40]My gun, a horny gun (she is), she down to f- all night (uh-huh, she will)\n[01:50.64]She wanna f- all night, (ye-yeah) vacuum, she wanna suck all night in my room (ye-ye-ye-yeah)\n[01:54.14]Rolls-Royce truck, Lambo truck, whatever one has the most legroom (skrrt)\n[01:57.00]Skrrt, that b- go vroom (skrrt)\n[01:58.72]I won't Tom Cruise her, the b- gon' move\n[02:00.16]Still live like a Mission Impossible dude (uh-huh)\n[02:01.88]Gun sing like it got autotune (uh-huh)\n[02:03.68]I'm T-Pain when it come to that tool (uh-huh)\n[02:05.02]Money got longer when it come to that Uz' (uh-huh)\n[02:06.88]Sip lean, I'm still awake, no snooze (uh-huh)\n[02:08.38]I'm on bullsh- like Carlos Booze' (tell them)\n[02:10.34]I'm swervin' with the Swervo tape all in my head (let's go)\n[02:13.76]I blow up like a turban on top of my head (let's go)\n[02:17.02]Codeine sip, ain't no Bourbon, no Bourbon in here (on God)\n[02:19.90]Even though I'm a cowboy, gun smoke in the air (uh-huh)\n[02:24.68]DJ Khaled, a hunnid racks, I made another one (uh-huh)\n[02:27.92]DJ Khaled with the tats, I got another one (uh-huh)\n[02:31.42]DJ Khaled, we the best, b-, I'm number one, uh-huh (let's go, let's go, let's go, let's go, let's go)\n[02:34.46]I'm rookie of the year, ain't no runnin' u-u-up (on God)\n[02:37.68]We ain't runnin' away from sh- we the ones runnin' u-u-up (that's on God)\n[02:41.56]No Limit gang, the only gang, ain't no other one (that's on God)\n[0